        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Accordingly, we strive to maintain and provide quality facilities, technology, equipment, employees and services for physicians and patients.",
        "start_character": 83134,
        "end_character": 83275
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-044769",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-044769-39c3e281a408cb49",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-044769",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-10",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Generally, other hospitals and facilities in the communities we serve provide services similar to those we offer.",
        "start_character": 79744,
        "end_character": 79857
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-044769",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-044769-39c3e281a408cb49",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-044769",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-10",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In some states where we operate hospitals and other health care providers, the construction or expansion of health care facilities, the transfer or change of ownership of existing facilities, capital expenditures and the addition of new beds or services may be subject to review by and prior approval of, or notifications to, state regulatory agencies under a CON program.",
        "start_character": 92882,
        "end_character": 93254
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-044769",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-044769-39c3e281a408cb49",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-044769",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-10",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Some of the states in which we operate have laws prohibiting corporations and other entities not owned by physicians or other permitted health professionals from employing physicians or certain other health professionals, practicing medicine for a profit and making certain direct and indirect payments to, or entering into fee-splitting arrangements with, health care providers designed to induce or encourage the referral of patients to, or the recommendation of, particular providers for medical products and services.",
        "start_character": 120821,
        "end_character": 121342
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-044769",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-044769-39c3e281a408cb49",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-044769",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We continue to monitor all aspects of our business and have developed a comprehensive ethics and compliance program that is designed to meet or exceed applicable federal guidelines and industry standards.",
        "start_character": 122653,
        "end_character": 122857
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-044769",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-044769-39c3e281a408cb49",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-044769",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-10",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "A number of states in which we operate have adopted their own false claims provisions as well as their own whistleblower provisions under which a private party may file a civil lawsuit in state court.",
        "start_character": 112300,
        "end_character": 112500
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-044769",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-044769-39c3e281a408cb49",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-044769",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-10",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Additionally, the number of freestanding specialty hospitals, surgery centers, emergency departments, urgent care centers, diagnostic and imaging centers and other medical facilities in the geographic areas in which we operate continues to increase.",
        "start_character": 79858,
        "end_character": 80107
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-044769",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-044769-39c3e281a408cb49",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-044769",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Additionally, we are developing enterprise-wide, colleague-facing upskilling programs as well as partnering with academic institutions to create training programs that bolster the allied health talent pipeline.",
        "start_character": 146966,
        "end_character": 147176
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-044769",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-044769-39c3e281a408cb49",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-044769",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-10",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Although physicians may at any time terminate their relationship with a hospital we operate, our hospitals seek to retain physicians with varied specialties on the hospitals’ medical staffs and to attract other qualified physicians.",
        "start_character": 82598,
        "end_character": 82830
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-044769",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-044769-39c3e281a408cb49",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-044769",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As part of these efforts, we are implementing a new EHR platform across our facilities that is designed to help improve care coordination, enhance data integrity and interoperability, and drive operating efficiencies and cost savings.",
        "start_character": 83276,
        "end_character": 83510
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-044769",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-044769-39c3e281a408cb49",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-044769",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-10",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Certain states in which we operate have submitted applications to CMS for approval where the grandfathered payments we receive could be impacted and, in some instances, increased.",
        "start_character": 59344,
        "end_character": 59523
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-044769",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-044769-39c3e281a408cb49",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-044769",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-10",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Currently, most states in which we operate have adopted statewide provider taxes to fund the non-federal share of Medicaid programs within the state.",
